<title>GERMANY: Linde group nine-mo turnover up 6.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Linde group nine-mo turnover up 6.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to</p>
<p>end-September 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group turnover			     6.38    up 6.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    6.44    up 1.8 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Linde AG is a German engineering group.</p>
</text>
